    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Hi Camila, hi Diego. Thanks for setting this up so quickly.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T18:00:06Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T18:00:10Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "I read the case study on the weekend and it made me curious, so I asked Diego to join. He looks after our POS integration.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T18:00:14Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T18:00:24Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Diego Faria"
      },
      "text": "Our POS vendor exports the sales every night. I'm not sure we can get anything closer to real time for the franchisees.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T18:00:58Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T18:01:06Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "A nightly export could be enough for a first version. What matters most to the franchise team?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T18:02:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T18:02:37Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "So the main thing we would need from you before we go any further is",
